1
00:00:07,993 --> 00:00:09,860
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:10,011 --> 00:00:12,144
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,206 --> 00:00:17,362
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,233 --> 00:00:22,019
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,804 --> 00:00:27,711
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,426
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,682 --> 00:00:34,971
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,093 --> 00:00:39,528
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,497 --> 00:00:44,164
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,859 --> 00:00:48,935
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,302 --> 00:00:52,928
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,731 --> 00:00:58,126
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,204 --> 00:01:01,964
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,464 --> 00:01:08,326
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,165 --> 00:01:15,779
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:18,611
=Episode 26=

17
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:32,680
Officer Luo.

18
00:01:42,204 --> 00:01:43,768
(Xincheng Road Traffic Accident,
Lin'an, Shicheng)

19
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:49,760
Turn yourself in.

20
00:01:53,319 --> 00:01:54,040
Lin Che.

21
00:01:54,319 --> 00:01:55,319
You've been with me for six years.

22
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,000
And you still believe that?

23
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:58,719
Believe what?

24
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:02,799
That everything is black and white.

25
00:02:03,359 --> 00:02:04,439
You're a cop.

26
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:05,560
A cop?

27
00:02:06,239 --> 00:02:09,039
I've put in decades of hard work.

28
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:10,199
What did it get me?

29
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:13,840
I couldn't even help my own brother.

30
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,439
That's no excuse to serve the powerful

31
00:02:16,439 --> 00:02:17,719
and do their dirty work.

32
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:20,520
Fu.

33
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,599
You killed him, didn't you?

34
00:02:26,639 --> 00:02:27,710
Dongshan Tai knew

35
00:02:27,711 --> 00:02:28,960
the forensic findings.

36
00:02:29,599 --> 00:02:30,479
You leaked those too, didn't you?

37
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,120
After Nanhu Gang released Boss Hai,

38
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,000
you had him kidnapped.

39
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,520
So you killed Boss Hai too.

40
00:02:40,039 --> 00:02:40,759
You did all this

41
00:02:40,759 --> 00:02:42,280
to use the feud between the gangs,

42
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,479
destroy Nanhu Gang,

43
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,800
build up Dongcheng Gang,

44
00:02:45,039 --> 00:02:45,560
and then

45
00:02:46,159 --> 00:02:47,439
take control of it.

46
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:48,919
Am I right?

47
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:49,439
Yes.

48
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:50,800
I did it.

49
00:02:51,599 --> 00:02:53,560
A few gangsters died. So what?

50
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:54,639
Who'll remember them?

51
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:55,840
I will.

52
00:02:57,319 --> 00:02:58,199
What about everyone else?

53
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,879
They only care about money

54
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,840
and their own interests.

55
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,240
Power.

56
00:03:07,159 --> 00:03:08,560
Only with power

57
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:11,759
can you break free of all those rules

58
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,240
and make Shicheng a better place.

59
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,300
That's just an excuse

60
00:03:15,300 --> 00:03:16,439
to justify your crimes.

61
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,240
You have two choices.

62
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,639
Either work for me,

63
00:03:24,919 --> 00:03:25,360
or

64
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,960
go keep that fool company.

65
00:03:30,199 --> 00:03:31,879
I'd rather die than work for you.

66
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:46,840
Get him.

67
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:41,240
This is Luo Song.

68
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:42,839
Send backup now.

69
00:04:42,839 --> 00:04:43,680
Haiwan Pier.

70
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:55,879
Huogun.

71
00:04:56,399 --> 00:04:56,879
Are you okay?

72
00:04:56,879 --> 00:04:57,639
I'm fine, Boss Lin.

73
00:04:58,079 --> 00:04:59,199
Don't let Luo Song get away.

74
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,120
Be careful.

75
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,360
Stay back.

76
00:06:11,839 --> 00:06:12,639
Lin!

77
00:06:29,519 --> 00:06:30,519
Shen Yanlin.

78
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:33,480
Looks like you're late again.

79
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:10,680
Lin!

80
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:46,240
Search every inch.

81
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:47,839
(Dongcheng Tiger)
Search carefully.

82
00:07:48,319 --> 00:07:48,839
Yes.

83
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:03,480
Sir.

84
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,720
Can I have this?

85
00:08:53,461 --> 00:08:54,767
(No. 433)

86
00:09:09,012 --> 00:09:13,838
(Lin Che)

87
00:09:26,803 --> 00:09:29,834
(Lin Che)

88
00:09:31,879 --> 00:09:34,000
Fu, this drawing is so nice.

89
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,279
Why is that one so ugly?

90
00:09:36,519 --> 00:09:37,720
It's not ugly.

91
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:43,960
Lin.

92
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:47,639
For taking that knife for me,

93
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:50,799
I've decided...

94
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:52,879
What?

95
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:54,840
I'll teach you how to write.

96
00:09:56,399 --> 00:09:57,559
Bro.

97
00:09:58,320 --> 00:10:00,279
Are you thanking me or punishing me?

98
00:10:01,519 --> 00:10:02,039
- Quit whining.
- Okay.

99
00:10:09,747 --> 00:10:11,005
(Shen Yanlin)

100
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:12,480
Try writing it.

101
00:10:13,039 --> 00:10:14,279
Whoa.

102
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:15,960
That's so hard.

103
00:10:16,279 --> 00:10:16,960
I quit.

104
00:10:19,039 --> 00:10:19,600
Keep learning.

105
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,559
My name has three characters.

106
00:10:20,919 --> 00:10:21,559
They're so hard to write.

107
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,000
I want to learn your name.

108
00:10:24,399 --> 00:10:25,519
Yours only has two.

109
00:10:26,279 --> 00:10:27,513
If you can't write your own name,

110
00:10:27,514 --> 00:10:28,200
what are you going to do?

111
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,759
Then I'll just write yours.

112
00:10:30,292 --> 00:10:32,132
(Lin Che)

113
00:10:58,480 --> 00:10:59,320
(Boss Che)

114
00:10:59,321 --> 00:11:00,438
(Lin Che)

115
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:02,320
(You finally got to be Lin Che again.)

116
00:11:05,879 --> 00:11:07,440
I want to go back.

117
00:11:10,039 --> 00:11:11,639
I want to go back.

118
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,480
(But I...)

119
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:15,679
(can never go back.)

120
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:19,759
(I chose this path myself.)

121
00:11:20,799 --> 00:11:21,679
(I always knew)

122
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,960
(this day would come sooner or later.)

123
00:11:26,879 --> 00:11:27,759
(But you're different.)

124
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:33,279
(Keep moving forward.)

125
00:11:34,159 --> 00:11:35,480
(Be the good cop you wanted to be.)

126
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:37,519
(Live the life you wanted.)

127
00:11:43,589 --> 00:11:45,518
(Mr. Wan and Accomplices' Crime Records)

128
00:11:45,519 --> 00:11:47,440
(This is all I can do for you now.)

129
00:11:54,919 --> 00:11:56,559
(Goodbye, Boss Che.)

130
00:12:09,958 --> 00:12:11,732
♪I have one wish♪

131
00:12:12,007 --> 00:12:14,678
♪For us to see the same light♪

132
00:12:15,252 --> 00:12:17,301
♪Though I've never seen it either♪

133
00:12:17,374 --> 00:12:19,725
♪I think I know what it looks like♪

134
00:12:23,534 --> 00:12:25,005
♪We're all the same♪

135
00:12:25,536 --> 00:12:28,265
♪We were once lost and helpless kids♪

136
00:12:28,585 --> 00:12:30,772
♪We've hit the walls of reality♪

137
00:12:31,227 --> 00:12:34,770
♪We don't want to be covered in scars♪

138
00:12:36,303 --> 00:12:39,241
♪Through ordinary days♪

139
00:12:39,525 --> 00:12:41,623
♪I know that I'm♪

140
00:12:42,630 --> 00:12:44,327
♪Not invincible♪

141
00:12:44,328 --> 00:12:48,213
♪And sometimes I'm still afraid♪

142
00:12:49,705 --> 00:12:53,016
♪Sometimes lost, sometimes confused♪

143
00:12:53,212 --> 00:12:55,825
♪Sometimes I don't know where I'm going♪

144
00:12:56,252 --> 00:12:58,301
♪But I know♪

145
00:12:58,567 --> 00:13:02,238
♪There's still a long hard road ahead♪

146
00:13:02,570 --> 00:13:05,370
♪Look up♪

147
00:13:05,694 --> 00:13:09,054
♪Gaze into the endless night♪

148
00:13:09,236 --> 00:13:13,410
♪Believe a shooting star will streak by♪

149
00:13:13,687 --> 00:13:15,932
♪And light up your dreams♪

150
00:13:16,123 --> 00:13:17,994
♪Open your arms♪

151
00:13:18,679 --> 00:13:19,799
What are you doing here?

152
00:13:20,559 --> 00:13:21,799
I came to save you.

153
00:13:22,530 --> 00:13:25,587
♪Let love's warmth turn into a rainbow♪

154
00:13:25,812 --> 00:13:28,412
